   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Whilst profitability and cash flow performance to the end of February 2022 has been close to expectation, in order to further assess the company's ability to continue to trade as a going concern, management have performed an exercise to assess a reasonable worst-case trading scenario and the impact of this on profit and cash.",
