  {
   "d": "2022-09-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "The second half of the year has started resiliently with record temperatures in the UK and Europe positively impacting demand for the Group's air conditioning units and chillers. This increased summer demand leads management to be optimistic over the full year results.",
